    "Customer codes, the mapping of outlets to territories — what used to live as a hard-coded dictionary inside the code. Declare a lookup table as an input in the manifest: the platform creates it for you, keeps its versions, shows who is responsible for it and which values found no match. Whoever is responsible updates it — with no new version of your bundle.": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:346"
    },
    "Data": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:37"
    },
