    "Download PDF": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/diploma.html:25"
    },
    "Every run records which folders were connected, which files were read, which sheets and columns were opened — and how that differs from what the manifest declared. The result is a graph: folder → pattern → sheet → generator → output → report. This is the answer to «where does this number come from», a question that usually has none.": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:314"
    },
    "Files across the folders": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:490"
    },
    "Folder path reported by the desktop app": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/data_sources.html:236"
