    "Folders": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/data_sources.html:39"
    },
    "From here on the report needs no manual update. If the same table arrives every week, take the second road: a generator will assemble this very report by itself, and the platform will remember which files it came from.": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:218"
    },
    "From this moment the report is not a file in an inbox. It has an address, versions (the old one stays and can be downloaded), an access list, a link for outside viewing, comments laid over the page, and a colours tab where the owner re-paints the report right in the browser.": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:185"
    },
    "HTML budget: heavier than that, and the data moves into a separate file": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:72"
    },
    "I need a report": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:115"
    },
    "If the file works when opened from a folder, it will almost certainly work on the platform too. Check four things:": {
      "ref": "templates/pages/docs.html:155"
    },
