    "The engine opens a session, hands over the files {b}one at a time{b_} and asks for the result. After add_file returns, only aggregates may remain of a file: collecting frames in a list and concatenating them in finish() is forbidden — on a year of data the naive version hit the tab's ceiling (~2.75 GB), while the disciplined one held 468 MB flat.": {
